{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「KINGDOM HEARTS Collection [I～III]」發售！與同伴一同冒險迪士尼與皮克斯的世界吧</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3d99983778427048eeda890ed774d0a202e9289382577343a1c8ad59fb5cc9c5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6ab815b6416b452716e0e5e7cdb0ca66.jpg\"/><p>將「王國之心」至「王國之心 III」為止的作品集結成套的「 KINGDOM HEARTS Collection [I～III] 」已於 2026年10月8日(四) 發售。 對應平台為Nintendo Switch 2、PlayStation 5、XBOX Series X|S、Microsoft Store on Windows。</p><h3>「KINGDOM HEARTS Collection [I～III]」終於發售！</h3><p>將2002年3月28日(四)發售的「王國之心」至「王國之心 III」為止集結成套的3款作品「 KINGDOM HEARTS Collection [I～III] 」於2026年10月8日(四)發售。 本作品是「 KINGDOM HEARTS -HD 1.5+2.5 ReMIX- 」「 KINGDOM HEARTS HD 2.8 Final Chapter Prologue 」「 KINGDOM HEARTS III + Re Mind(DLC) 」3款作品集結成套。</p><h3>迪士尼與皮克斯的各式作品登場！</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b62fff19f2c66404d59c9b697d4b103c8a2f096d0d91588bc1a2ea9eee8c8957/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc5c6aa4bec2776e375033397a413a708.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/166cf531e5aa00a89f5dce8ae41c01a68ac2f002f6c30fa423d482d8ff0db92a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb4d10b3d371f2d3c7ca9f7e5844a01a6.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3c30e0266af88f564ee35b17051bc8a0497da36562dead74985385a808bfb17e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F283f38f014969825ebeea1147f643863.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e8ce7d3f3e2a363d7624634e8137c8259866e2b89f2579999c8e1340a685105e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5bfd037f8fd1d3fda3e8b2e3d71fd31d.jpg\"/><p>在「王國之心」系列中，可透過主角・ 索拉 的冒險，與迪士尼及皮克斯世界的角色們相遇。 每個世界會改變的索拉一行人外貌，以及能直接享受電影世界觀的畫面也值得注目！</p><h3>以簡單的按鈕操作，與迪士尼及皮克斯的同伴們夢幻共演</h3><p>KINGDOM HEARTS III</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f866c9e81f1f790cacab288ade41fff3b052572930059ff0a1945bff2b8db7bd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F021d3f852092b78de14ab87fc1a69b0d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2eeba102efb1afbf0528ecfae2a8db48272edde42ff7bc276e04be7674134cf3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F192548923e18be6ae400365293d1b3e8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/38b3add6544218fe2f61ad875d66247329035124863e285c590ab0a1bccd4de1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F013c42f5f46d2dd866adbacf051e99a6.jpg\"/><p>在「王國之心」中，以索拉的武器「鑰匙劍」攻擊為中心，一邊接受唐老鴨的魔法或高飛的盾等支援，一邊推進冒險。 由於可用簡單的按鈕操作遊玩，即使是對動作遊戲不熟悉的人，也能體感爽快且充滿魄力的戰鬥。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b2b90148d9fcf17a3e317cb782b63b3ce89dde6c8eb876c0a8bf92caedf10a5c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F96993692010e4414cf66ef29b85860a6.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5c17fc5f355a5ade44321d385bfbed8ad37c3f2dee63b907bedc88c58deaf956/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fad33bd2dc55f6ccffe23aa920d11fb31.jpg\"/><p>作為本系列特徵的，與各世界登場的迪士尼及皮克斯角色們的「 連攜技 」也有！ 每個角色的演出與動作皆不同，表現出作品的個性。</p><p>小鹿斑比(作品: 小鹿斑比)(KINGDOM HEARTS -FINAL MIX-)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/805a0e67324aeb00ea98135e9ebb545f1201c94c68d23cb45765f76239845957/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F129f28ae6feef00b2d1e1807980b5a6b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2ac89093c3b29bb0b8345f2ada37831a628fdf12e42ff48e9e81c1b3ee749bdb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd89bce64740c95cac525040936dc98c1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1531378e65a71e4b701d6945c7173eae61d331216dab015d28dc1c1c4416e450/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F751436ac0b290ffaf88dfaf83849fdc5.jpg\"/><p>不僅是連攜技，也能透過魔法召喚小鹿斑比、精靈、史迪奇等角色來接受支援。</p><h3>充滿各作品魅力的迷你遊戲也有！</h3><p>小熊維尼(KINGDOM HEARTS III)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/08b85524f7af342086413cc9883cc3e6ee1114cf2c9caaaf1565f6ae28a02110/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe96c8ec542077aef6b93ec905d017860.jpg\"/><p>各世界也收錄了活用作品特徵的 迷你遊戲 。 在繪本中展開的「小熊維尼」的「百畝森林」中，可沉浸在收集蜂蜜或田地收成的益智遊戲等悠閒的世界。</p><p>五星級大鼠(KINGDOM HEARTS III)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4de31f8eed95376a0fa56c75824451ce26f540ce1d3ed52669516dd351c43fe3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F88c14f25124677d94a991bc254bdcb56.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0a7d69e40a56aefddc1e83a064f454acaf2495fc6042a021b48364d0f1990f7b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd0f8a4e61ba078ebf5eae26db9d81b92.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f07486e72f0f31ae8662c62053391eb06ea7803f052a315ae6de4ac2bd0fb967/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbadb1e820ef271b735acabafa098eaf6.jpg\"/><p>更進一步，與小米一起料理、與愛麗兒等人以音樂劇唱歌跳舞、騎著光之摩托奔馳網路空間吧。</p><h3>以主題樂園遊樂設施為主題的大絕招「遊樂設施連段」</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8a0688f8abe2d2ca57e4e7498317b2d841e957d29bc6a2a8e05d464cd09e75f3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F238dad057684e44d73f237e2269d364b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/189f8de4ef0f1c4915e14fdc65de2a10f8f99f1ca409b0e6e3a601e0f7efeb25/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa2cacfb18ad3eb664748f8859c7c40cc.jpg\"/><p>在「KINGDOM HEARTS III」中，登場了以雲霄飛車、旋轉木馬、咖啡杯等主題樂園遊樂設施為主題的大絕招「遊樂設施連段」。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/40757aec4f25f8ade8610d9471cedc724df002a9551593f6485fc10572ab0cec/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F483c2a33e5292a07bf528969f576cc0b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2ca506b4eadd6e11971afd5d9a3528599998e095550ae963729d3bd80a226eb3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa8c5b2af3625b1c310d4d5b9a3d0d4fa.jpg\"/><p>透過鮮豔的霓虹色彩與充滿動感的演出，可品味宛如在主題樂園遊玩般的臨場感與爽快感。</p><h3>撼動世界的反派們「迪士尼反派」也暗中活躍</h3><p>沉睡魔咒(作品: 睡美人)(KINGDOM HEARTS III)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/28a83d5bfe71fa6a6781ba900daebb2090d2d5467e540c56fe9905ffbd7af658/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5731894c30f45d7b9bb039cb6d711cd8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/528e5910d01806e9f68663ef37912fef2b23a9c82d58ee3dc09eb4557aba9704/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb32899123fa01faf267e0f2e0baf4095.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4c502ce9e67abc3a130904fcb33d6863976f877f5a5381c0c11ab1ba49b97f62/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4f68ecdfaa09b554839ebd9822be73fb.jpg\"/><p>以「睡美人」的沉睡魔咒為首，「海克力斯」的黑帝斯、「彼得潘」的虎克船長等撼動世界的反派們在本作品中也暗中活躍。 率領黑暗勢力，阻擋在索拉一行人面前，為故事帶來更進一步的緊迫感。</p><h3>支援索拉的「Final Fantasy」系列角色們！</h3><p>故事中，展開宿命對決的克勞德與賽菲羅斯，作為索拉一行人的良好理解者、面對世界危機的雷恩(史克爾)與比比、尤娜等也登場。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/172882079e555353f91dfdd4fbf825730ed0110e8eb538aa8711e24bd8c4d883/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdedbe54f98ccc289e661afa73bdd020c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/16dce2c68e9238b1df364b52e300183d6505591151fb09eb0e340b90ed838120/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7cbaaca336559058a7e6685297186cae.jpg\"/><p>克勞德(FINAL FANTASY VII)</p><p>史克爾(FINAL FANTASY VIII)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dfe6865e03dbac825bdf94ce0e24b9b1cc2af52547945a066cba7e425ed0b02d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9b3b080b9909403db7ad34f833db38dc.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a7625a72242942f8f766cb6ea75cbc8391e7da4ced640051be902e5c1c1b64c9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc83b902001ef4bd00a5dccb42600e845.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4362d94e3ae3af76161a9bf46c5692f878237a27b1e600415d39c7eec6ae0eca/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F973277014a1b1dd3a52e8fcfa3faff9c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b02ae6618184959d1846cdb7ad93ec16ffc7c1034aaba740d17685552bede718/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe79bb15fb6f0e424575520ce3b20b6a6.jpg\"/><p>克勞德(FINAL FANTASY VII ADVENT CHILDREN)</p><p>蒂法(FINAL FANTASY VII ADVENT CHILDREN)</p><p>賽菲羅斯(FINAL FANTASY VII ADVENT CHILDREN)</p><p>比比(FINAL FANTASY IX)</p><p>尤娜(FINAL FANTASY X-2)</p><p>琉克(FINAL FANTASY X-2)</p><p>派茵(FINAL FANTASY X-2)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/68864ae0fb8dd6d77c56546fdfd3ae3602e1c0fc3d0fa5da04abb04450c16d31/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F771635662a4d2a3ecba5d456d28ed665.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4d534eaf1c7d0fa6d562b3ad107aa9b7a10c9b50691ab09593f372e2c7434717/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc4f6ab42009e387d37b9e6ebefb32df7.jpg\"/><p>艾莉絲(FINAL FANTASY VII)</p><p>尤菲(FINAL FANTASY VIII)</p><p>席德(FINAL FANTASY VII)</p><h3>「KINGDOM HEARTS III」體驗版發布中！</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/596e010fce557c6780fe144818527545503b5fd0cab0904b533bf687aa649c50/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9f0f650f4cb3faba8d4b7a34ce4f5484.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2815f0253e36a347fd2a44ef72d6198703ce7673f530c49f8a41536d5e2b004d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcb217952dd90bd2260c1758619673e16.jpg\"/><p>體驗版可遊玩「KINGDOM HEARTS III」序盤以「海克力斯」為舞台的「奧林帕斯」與以「玩具總動員」為舞台的「玩具箱」2種。</p><h3>購買特典</h3><p>購買特典</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1871649a5768a0f148d8340b4b91ac1fd7523e3f561730943bdc82519e00f13d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa8b1b9480a05d512448d04114188c034.jpg\"/><p>購買「王國之心III + Re Mind」或「KINGDOM HEARTS Collection [I～III]」任一款，即可獲得遊戲內可使用的鑰匙劍。</p><p>「KHIII」可使用的武器 Long Night</p><p>「KHIII」可使用的武器 Midnight Blue</p><p>「KHIII」可使用的武器 Phantom Green</p><h3>可透過「Nintendo Switch Cloud Version」繼承保存資料</h3><p>若曾購買「Nintendo Switch Cloud Version」，可於Nintendo eShop以折扣價格購買以下作品的Nintendo Switch 2版，並繼承保存資料。</p><p>KINGDOM HEARTS INTEGRUM MASTERPIECE for Cloud</p><p>KINGDOM HEARTS - HD 1.5+2.5 ReMIX - Cloud Version</p><p>KINGDOM HEARTS HD 2.8 Final Chap